    "detailed_description": "Atlas Online: 2D MMORPG Pirate Adventure<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWelcome to Atlas Online, the 2D MMORPG pirate game! In this thrilling pirate adventure, fight for your own glory, conquer islands with your alliance, embark on new adventures, and rule the seas!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nStep into a world where every wave holds a treasure and danger lurks around every corner. Gather your crew, customize your ship, and venture into dangerous waters in search of fortune and fame. Form alliances, join epic battles, and emerge as the most feared pirate captain of the seven seas.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWith stunning visuals and immersive gameplay, Atlas Online offers an unforgettable adventure for anyone brave enough to embark on the journey. Are you ready to chart your own course, claim your destiny, and become a legend of the high seas?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nJoin the adventure in Atlas Online today!",
